            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/34e117be5191c309e6c5ec35ed10e54e.poster.avif?t=1747737518\" width=550 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/34e117be5191c309e6c5ec35ed10e54e.webm?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/34e117be5191c309e6c5ec35ed10e54e.mp4?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Smoke and Sacrifice é um RPG aberto baseado na narrativa, onde a chave para a tua sobrevivência é explorar os ecossistemas. Constrói, luta, sobrevive e explora o enorme mundo aberto nesta aventura gótica pintada à mão, onde cada personagem tem a sua história para contar.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/a8bb070610f4d0762935c490f3831a44.poster.avif?t=1747737518\" width=550 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/a8bb070610f4d0762935c490f3831a44.webm?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/a8bb070610f4d0762935c490f3831a44.mp4?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>O lar de Sachi é a última terra fértil num mundo destroçado e gélido. Os agricultores da sua aldeia prosperam graças à sua fé na Árvore do Sol, que substitui a antiga luz perdida. Após sacrificar o seu filho para a Árvore do Sol, Sachi descobre um segredo sombrio debaixo da aura clerical. Irá ela descobrir a verdade escondida no submundo secreto, ou morrer no seu fumo mortífero e envolvente?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/7f1cd7a874d651cd828facb910bb4c84.poster.avif?t=1747737518\" width=550 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/7f1cd7a874d651cd828facb910bb4c84.webm?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/7f1cd7a874d651cd828facb910bb4c84.mp4?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Com tudo contra ela, estranhas criaturas à espreita a cada passo e o fumo ameaçador à espera para roubar vida e memória, irá Sachi descobrir o que aconteceu ao seu filho?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/d5ae85067c80f673317af79c53a5fac6.poster.avif?t=1747737518\" width=550 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/d5ae85067c80f673317af79c53a5fac6.webm?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/695100/extras/d5ae85067c80f673317af79c53a5fac6.mp4?t=1747737518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
